    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncle Kenny The Game</strong> is a throwback 2D platformer with fun, fast-paced action gameplay and a variety of mechanics and weapons at your disposal.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BASED OFF OF THE ANIMATED WEB-SERIES ON THE &quot;MAGIK CHEESE&quot; YOUTUBE CHANNEL!</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Full Controller support</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Fully voiced dialogue!</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete 5-6 hour story experience unfolding over three distinct acts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>A varied and energetic OST:</u>\u00a0Made mostly by me, along with a few tracks by friends!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Swingshot: </u> a tool utilized by Uncle Kenny to swing his way through several areas while fighting off enemies simultaneously </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Fun Shoot 'em up Gameplay: </u> Which evolves as Uncle Kenny furthers his collection of weapons! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHAT YOU MAY FIND IN ACT 2- </strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>A Spooky New Environment:</u> To explore and find secrets in! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Flamethrower </u> Annihilate your enemies with a fiery touch  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHAT WILL BLOW YOUR MIND IN ACT 3 ON AUGUST 22ND, 2025\u00a0</strong>-\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>TELEPATHY POWERS!!!</u></strong>\u00a0Control enemies with your mind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>SKILL TREE!!</u></strong>\u00a0Tailor Uncle Kenny's playstyle to your liking! Upgrade move speed, special weapon abilities and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>THE JETPACK:</u></strong>\u00a0Soar high above your puny opponents!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>PORTALS:</u></strong> Test your skills with mind-bending puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>HOVER BIKE:</u></strong> Travel at unimaginable speeds high above the ground!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>EXCITING ENDING TO THE STORY!!</u></strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note From The Developer:</i>\u00a0Thank you to no end for checking out my video game. Solo development has been an extremely fun and challenging experience. I have wanted to make video games my entire life, and hope this is good enough of a portfolio project to get me a job in the industry.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I WOULD BE HAPPY TO READ ANY COMMENTS, SUGGESTIONS, OR REPORTS OF BUGS/GLITCHES EITHER IN A REVIEW OR STEAM DISCUSSION!!!! THANK YOU SO MUCH!!!</strong> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncle Kenny The Game</strong> is a throwback 2D platformer with fun, fast-paced action gameplay and a variety of mechanics and weapons at your disposal.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BASED OFF OF THE ANIMATED WEB-SERIES ON THE &quot;MAGIK CHEESE&quot; YOUTUBE CHANNEL!</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Full Controller support</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Fully voiced dialogue!</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete 5-6 hour story experience unfolding over three distinct acts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>A varied and energetic OST:</u>\u00a0Made mostly by me, along with a few tracks by friends!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Swingshot: </u> a tool utilized by Uncle Kenny to swing his way through several areas while fighting off enemies simultaneously </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Fun Shoot 'em up Gameplay: </u> Which evolves as Uncle Kenny furthers his collection of weapons! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHAT YOU MAY FIND IN ACT 2- </strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>A Spooky New Environment:</u> To explore and find secrets in! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Flamethrower </u> Annihilate your enemies with a fiery touch  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHAT WILL BLOW YOUR MIND IN ACT 3 ON AUGUST 22ND, 2025\u00a0</strong>-\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>TELEPATHY POWERS!!!</u></strong>\u00a0Control enemies with your mind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>SKILL TREE!!</u></strong>\u00a0Tailor Uncle Kenny's playstyle to your liking! Upgrade move speed, special weapon abilities and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>THE JETPACK:</u></strong>\u00a0Soar high above your puny opponents!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>PORTALS:</u></strong> Test your skills with mind-bending puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>HOVER BIKE:</u></strong> Travel at unimaginable speeds high above the ground!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>EXCITING ENDING TO THE STORY!!</u></strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note From The Developer:</i>\u00a0Thank you to no end for checking out my video game. Solo development has been an extremely fun and challenging experience. I have wanted to make video games my entire life, and hope this is good enough of a portfolio project to get me a job in the industry.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I WOULD BE HAPPY TO READ ANY COMMENTS, SUGGESTIONS, OR REPORTS OF BUGS/GLITCHES EITHER IN A REVIEW OR STEAM DISCUSSION!!!! THANK YOU SO MUCH!!!</strong> </p>",
